  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df48b56459b71707e7ae811d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在粉丝交流会上加深交流，\n把大家的心意都塞满在胸口。",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fee967b50bbc81e449ae909fc3720b92f65b5a13a210e7ef69beecc1ceab15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1530"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f175779e81f191ab2f2e704",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是飞往世界各地的家人发来的LANE。\n由羁绊紧紧相连的心，让我变得更加坚强。",
      "source_fingerprint": "158d4c00dabec3053ddcf9197da5b1519dadf17fa7a878d824286b980907b0d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1531"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff6beec14dddbf4aaa87debe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先……我要和训练员一起细细品味\n这次的喜悦。为了下一次能再次展翅高飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a91a09a010ef74aaf86650760d7a72cc3af55ffa1d21d2cab76635e24d0d59b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1532"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed46260bade73a271a0aa9b1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，我没有停下脚步的时间。\n在将世界连结起来之前，必须要一直奔跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "766092968ff19272f9a49a365d658140895b4d75ee1c2e7ac9b9571e83858d5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1533"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43ab60807cb9db0cb9bd3fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了能连结起缘分，我吃了一个甜甜圈。\n注入了我的心意，慢慢地品尝了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9dda91d8d7680ebe20699fc212f9054189be0222afa05918cc7c73255e5b2b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1534"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d265cd6db8e5b2957c34e1d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "首先……我要和训练员一起细细品味\n这次的喜悦。为了下一次能再次展翅高飞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a91a09a010ef74aaf86650760d7a72cc3af55ffa1d21d2cab76635e24d0d59b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1535"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dfac3e61d500b355aa245bd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的，我没有停下脚步的时间。\n在将世界连结起来之前，必须要一直奔跑下去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "766092968ff19272f9a49a365d658140895b4d75ee1c2e7ac9b9571e83858d5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1536"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be403412bb5d19e94665f375",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了能连结起缘分，我吃了一个甜甜圈。\n注入了我的心意，慢慢地品尝了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9dda91d8d7680ebe20699fc212f9054189be0222afa05918cc7c73255e5b2b3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1537"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92d87c1c30426c5edfd547e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的——重叠的欢呼声，与我的心\n紧紧相连。一次又一次……一次又一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f6728c0336ca75bb60e40e3a9118c08efdf030c0053d9959ea69588c983498",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1538"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e87065c1edee482edbc165f4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很幸福。能够和大家一起跑到最后，\n这种理所当然的事，比什么都宝贵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c5fb340b447b861ee146e3489c4689ec2caaab4c777a57d8f72fc90c1a5230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1539"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ccd00231487474c320bbdbef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我知道大家都很强！\\n正因如此我才想要超越大家……我会超越的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d26c7cddeac4bc52053097e9ee23c9ef13fadf95cf9cd663a7238a5fb160207b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "154"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7438c01087ef7ecd9208ef0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是的——重叠的欢呼声，与我的心\n紧紧相连。一次又一次……一次又一次。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f6728c0336ca75bb60e40e3a9118c08efdf030c0053d9959ea69588c983498",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1540"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7157934f7916d0802a99b52",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很幸福。能够和大家一起跑到最后，\n这种理所当然的事，比什么都宝贵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c5fb340b447b861ee146e3489c4689ec2caaab4c777a57d8f72fc90c1a5230",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1541"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ad91a184a3876a91541b1d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不能说没有影响，但对手也一样。\n我觉得这也是考验耐心的时候了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d04c3c625974408fa72ceadcd726fa28780bba0e43fbb0f874de4d1831f4c7c6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1542"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ff1350b8687ba069a28e98",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "毫无保留地，对所有人保持同等的警惕。\n并在此之上战胜所有人。这才是花形嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57d2317d89cf52204889d9cab50813ca8c3262175614c267b760b01cd9095d68",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1543"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c6d9e9dc50f2a731dba9f29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……嗯，有一个让人感到目眩般耀眼的目标。\n要是能稍微靠近她一点就好了呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77334df83315ae1d2bfc6fad324af5eafb8238e8958de951d81b7f8ecb8b476a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1544"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fca02f87ea21a8fdd6539b04",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在先忍着。等决赛赢了之后\n再买一束漂亮的花来庆祝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "056a67e9979ebfe1e9c4070c47670f5a2af503941dd50967db3b45a53ca7e99b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1545"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64b74d04a20daae40e0dbba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是呢，那个留着长发，似乎很适合紫色花朵\n的孩子，曾经跟我说过希望我为她加油呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3beb63a36867205080b9a221b20534f5b485252cc25f3be471e3d4dc92a1c069",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1546"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fed96a9431fa7363c6eae29",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……嗯，有一个让人感到目眩般耀眼的目标。\n要是能稍微靠近她一点就好了呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "77334df83315ae1d2bfc6fad324af5eafb8238e8958de951d81b7f8ecb8b476a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1547"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4dfab07feeceae42166bf0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在先忍着。等决赛赢了之后\n再买一束漂亮的花来庆祝吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "056a67e9979ebfe1e9c4070c47670f5a2af503941dd50967db3b45a53ca7e99b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1548"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7f9a41fed17087e5b5d1fc7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是呢，那个留着长发，似乎很适合紫色花朵\n的孩子，曾经跟我说过希望我为她加油呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3beb63a36867205080b9a221b20534f5b485252cc25f3be471e3d4dc92a1c069",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1549"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d355806f3bf234a4e3f5fe6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练我全都拼命做了，要说哪个比较特别……\\n啊，我等一下去问问看训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f8d0e665fcc83da01561099b7b811fb287c2bf3d6e8060248a3ed804dbfb0a6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "155"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72ee447eaa1aced0afff4cf1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸。但是我所追求的是更加\n令人瞠目的黄金。我会继续钻研的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "400ce512666050f7dae56f36e6cc1d1b4c1d640ff7b50e783f66907226f4815d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1550"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60c563f6c4ab2652f6c3a6d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是，是逗我笑……不对\n是一直鼓励我支持我的训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5dfe487ceecc12569eeaba1834e7d6db5ef2f746e5dd4902cb2073472da877",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1551"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41bd17f1ffac9b8f477b16e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很荣幸。但是我所追求的是更加\n令人瞠目的黄金。我会继续钻研的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "400ce512666050f7dae56f36e6cc1d1b4c1d640ff7b50e783f66907226f4815d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1552"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6b079dd138978bf2152c0f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "说的也是，是逗我笑……不对\n是一直鼓励我支持我的训练员呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e5dfe487ceecc12569eeaba1834e7d6db5ef2f746e5dd4902cb2073472da877",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1553"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780810a5532a332a54489c90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自由活动时间吧。我想进行自主训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47bf849e7c6d7041ea66b6b4bb180c9237735b3d1fbe49acb94bb62810871ae8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1554"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd036962c3a9907634051283",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我还想跑出能令自己更加满意的奔跑。\n仅此而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33c8aafb778e1fb464c25bd29588bef3592b563572c21521fa6aeee19ebaf114",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1555"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d3188b4c861ca6e81447495",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没什么特别的。\n这不过是必经之路，没什么好高兴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46091a8e09efd72c6b83e2b62f2265921d5425bfb3113fc0a6272d5b12bf9058",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1556"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f30116bb9cfe7cb7689e1f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果训练员提议的话。\n……因为也是关键时刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d32da5e3d99368b4ae26ee5e6d5ccb35088d922ef92132213157198029a83f06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1557"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811f92d1323200c5fc03a299",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拍摄了跑姿。这是训练员提出来的\n方案……我觉得很有效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec0bd692e02ab4f90d1469bcae685d6adef09e36d7e2ac2d75956cc25e3b810",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1558"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3164658334bbc96f6d7c5b5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "没什么特别的。\n这不过是必经之路，没什么好高兴的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46091a8e09efd72c6b83e2b62f2265921d5425bfb3113fc0a6272d5b12bf9058",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1559"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:044df3e62d9c1ca5a9954b06",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "呃，是场让我跑得很开心的竞赛。\\n赛场的风很舒服，景色也很漂亮……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa292b8648313ed6f9b0a6e5519af8992831954a2e418cf56136f4db6a6191d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "156"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b5aa9800db54d680fd176acd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如果训练员提议的话。\n……因为也是关键时刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d32da5e3d99368b4ae26ee5e6d5ccb35088d922ef92132213157198029a83f06",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1560"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b899f2239b7821c283347c87",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拍摄了跑姿。这是训练员提出来的\n方案……我觉得很有效果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aec0bd692e02ab4f90d1469bcae685d6adef09e36d7e2ac2d75956cc25e3b810",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1561"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed724c23b264ee9468d2ade4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是嘛…………不用客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80442ed9c86301efea9bc2fa13731be48779c8a6079e29336148acbe67b810f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1562"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df0b8421a76924e383a3d502",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（短暂的沉默后）\n去相信自己吧……直到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd565b4ba006dfeb179b56afa71d5d08c809b0da3aefa5a2fbbe1ee7460eaad2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1563"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aacafdda2784bc87030a515c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "是嘛…………不用客气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80442ed9c86301efea9bc2fa13731be48779c8a6079e29336148acbe67b810f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1564"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dca325b6c4c494541440504a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "（短暂的沉默后）\n去相信自己吧……直到最后。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd565b4ba006dfeb179b56afa71d5d08c809b0da3aefa5a2fbbe1ee7460eaad2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1565"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2609e283e93712d9366b45c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Thanks！　果然赛事最开心了！\n心灵之间炙热的碰撞，我已经完全沦陷了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c5cf4458e4ee8a9ca883cf02a9da04c8aca351c744bf6c0c619ba7d42d3a9ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1566"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8ce911a42fd74dfe3e67b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我要去爬行动物咖啡馆！　蛇还有鬣蜥，\n那冰凉鳞片的触感……总是能治愈我呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9313fbf794a99a4ae8e523c9af5cb3def9fe4a1882f4074a017b37bb0439567d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1567"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e6af6de4d45edf3cb7f287",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给远在美国的妈妈！　话虽如此，现在\n在观众席上的爸爸应该已经打过去了吧。呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187c37802a8b04ba28a17b9ae6ccaf54e0b2d174191b7dda963f2eeeecfcb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1568"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09e51cadb782ce7c05b62d92",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Indeed，我会把身体和精神锻炼得比现在更强\n给你看。首先……去深山里闭关特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a9cc99117001cc9828176c9c6b970c7c2dd749197db541d9fc9ece8c15b1b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1569"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca30c7ff2e41dfef6b257a78",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要说作战……其实就跟平常一样，\\n总之不把前头让给任何人，尽力向前跑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6a2f9e68cba489ce3b59dc87ea9fbca6ae02de15d1618c66471342ba6dbb4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "157"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90ff9820f70cdc2d6404c2f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便是在大舞台上，my heart也不会动摇！\n因为一直，都有默默支持着我的人在嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9602e362a63c4a388e18b7f0a58203e3d7b94bc3ff7d4e00f900edd5316db13b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1570"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66711caa9b125851d06aa7c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "给远在美国的妈妈！　话虽如此，现在\n在观众席上的爸爸应该已经打过去了吧。呵呵！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0187c37802a8b04ba28a17b9ae6ccaf54e0b2d174191b7dda963f2eeeecfcb83",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345ddba0ea735cd1e93d1e54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Indeed，我会把身体和精神锻炼得比现在更强\n给你看。首先……去深山里闭关特训吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9a9cc99117001cc9828176c9c6b970c7c2dd749197db541d9fc9ece8c15b1b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1572"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64248479f4cccdaed96d9ae1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "即便是在大舞台上，my heart也不会动摇！\n因为一直，都有默默支持着我的人在嘛♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9602e362a63c4a388e18b7f0a58203e3d7b94bc3ff7d4e00f900edd5316db13b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1573"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95422e90898cd20f4c8bd58c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course！　接下来要开3天的派对呢！\n不让大家的目光钉在我的舞姿上可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd09d2454eba3b559a4767977eb38c56cdf97c62c53626d7ea91948ae6b7387",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1574"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88e6349bd2cc30025a332048",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "女王的跑姿，已经深深烙印在你们的眼里了吧？\n闪耀的我，今后也要尽情地注视着哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502b644bfb7a94bbbf4cf7704fe072d30bb8793de8db75382a9a4a8e7c4dbeeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1575"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c2b9b818c66430e288f37d3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "Of course！　接下来要开3天的派对呢！\n不让大家的目光钉在我的舞姿上可不行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cd09d2454eba3b559a4767977eb38c56cdf97c62c53626d7ea91948ae6b7387",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1576"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcd4d1671f75f92fb7d7cc55",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "女王的跑姿，已经深深烙印在你们的眼里了吧？\n闪耀的我，今后也要尽情地注视着哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "502b644bfb7a94bbbf4cf7704fe072d30bb8793de8db75382a9a4a8e7c4dbeeb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1577"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2b91d444af0a01dfa1a73ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "胜利会自己向我走来的吧。在故事的最后\n带来光明的，必然是身为圣女的我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6707e8e8c735e8ee75ca880e344d2742fd4189156b78738773d061b74e38d2f9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1578"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f8c4a5e4c01d506cf47dab3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那是带来神圣光芒的力量。净化邪恶、\n拯救世界的光辉，下一场赛事也请继续见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c3860ce0c6f9910a12fa07e43037b360b971385ff7dbd38f33dbbe426e688d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1579"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca6e15578032f60f66c197df",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我看到了令人想就那样不断跑下去……\\n既新奇又亮眼的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "45905bf071364d583207bb63c38e480c4e24fed2e92706a438f38273fbe7cd99",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "158"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f933f33d7f74524274296971",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1580"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:226bc07ad7824cd810a13de4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1581"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1df1af109ba05f3400346690",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1582"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:646d8c1264de5c594a532559",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我想和粉丝们一起分享热腾腾的炖菜。\n与人分享，正是圣女的本愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e0d5befdf03365b2f70dcc7fa367e1991755a905d6ca0b20d533ffd8564b84a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1583"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bcc60832c1b51b50d45afe5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我只是循着光明的轨迹前进罢了。\n我能看得很清楚……因为我是圣女嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4b7030bf3dc300cd88f8191d55a36b86b7d6c3701b1f0cdb68444e4a55f84c8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1584"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdc29c70eb0f4ecd4f51f854",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在克服困难感到满足的同时，我也感到战栗。\n为了能够迎接更为艰险的试炼……决赛而欣喜！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5827b819cf96daeb40d6994541b1da408e549a5c619a78951ef980f4afa35ec4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1585"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72090f476d72bd44ef58c0a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1586"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99e53ff9bf34d5cd9e298db6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1587"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ce6b15d16cd1c081b6dee54",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拜托请找伏特加小姐。\n……还有，能不能改成定期连载呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "42ea02e321ef44db5ca8884516324d45ff91b9f7f0ff0a0456856601b48a9ff2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1588"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d15b4294c823ef3a5ab74f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请环顾四周。这就是我和训练员\n照亮的世界的样子——是多么耀眼而尊贵啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57370b796466eb00251b9dbc7b9f6757060ddd93ab65683fc672bb6f4a152f31",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1589"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c1ce4af66942e117ec76e2e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那当然是让其他人全都相形失色的……\\n没事！会长在瞪我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "270e204e99cb67ed9dc1858ea7d609d62ca2cf91a2dfbf7d5e01fb3e5fd941ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "159"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b04e9ee3fc8136d782cd2f11",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了让心情平静下来，想去植物园……。\n触碰到泥土的香气——就会被治愈呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "adc3d6fcd7bc7456b49e2c61b086da740675d59700f6bdab41772b3f35c8a261",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1590"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a709e3333f37cdd4587b593",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了能将胜利的一朵鲜花——交到您手上……。\n我会去挑战的。带着坚定的——必胜的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f489c4d0f390d42dc333e33bd9de27b090a36d70631f72688feef7ad84d08fe6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1591"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db1f4abdcbd8bb8c34a465f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e301e315a321142aee2d11f76082e569e477296be2ea955afd1282d2bd06f39c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1592"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc944c7a7e87fb6f3bc2bf6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "想起了事前的——训练员的，指导。\n感觉就像是我们在共同奔跑一样……令人非常安心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2553cbc83861206e70e438c3fe9194b69bd357b1a984861f0681b6b6ebf6161f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1593"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f708f88c556f4b5f02b67e1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "和青梅竹马一起吃了——很『可爱』的松饼。\n食用花，真的很招人喜欢呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21160e0df0ce093fcc724658f5daec8b6fa28e5bef6ebfa11f6f4e083072e2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "232",
        "1594"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:970771ed9d2eb4849099003a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "不可思议的是，没怎么感到……。大概是因为\n我相信着训练员倾注的心血吧。",
